    "title": "Niagara Square fills with mourners honoring Charlie Kirk's legacy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago BUFFALO, N.Y. — Dozens of people attended a memorial honoring Charlie Kirk on Wednesday night at Niagara Square. The event was hosted by The Constitutional Coalition of NYS, and it followed a nationwide trend of remembrances for Kirk, who founded Turning Point USA. The popular conservative youth organizer was killed Sept. 10 after being shot at during an event at Utah Valley University in Orem, Utah. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
